    "name": "ask_user",
    "description": "Ask the user for additional information to disambiguate the request. IMPORTANT: Use friendly device names only - NO technical entity IDs like 'media_player.office_sonos'. Example: Say 'Office Sonos' not 'Office Sonos (media_player.office_sonos)'.",
